# Sammylove - Monetization Configuration

## Ad Networks Configuration

### 1. Google AdSense
ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID=your_adsense_client_id
ADSENSE_SLOT_ID=your_adsense_slot_id

### 2. Adsterra
ADSTERRA_ZONE_ID=your_adsterra_zone_id
ADSTERRA_PUBLISHER_ID=your_adsterra_publisher_id

### 3. PropellerAds
PROPELLER_ZONE_ID=your_propeller_zone_id

### 4. Affiliate Links (for premium features)
AFFILIATE_DOWNLOAD_TRACKER=your_affiliate_tracking_code

### 5. Premium Features
ENABLE_PREMIUM=true
PREMIUM_PRICE=9.99
STRIPE_PUBLIC_KEY=your_stripe_public_key
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=your_stripe_secret_key

### Database
DATABASE_URL=mongodb://localhost:27017/sammylove
# or use MongoDB Atlas
# MONGODB_ATLAS_URL=your_mongodb_atlas_connection_string

### Server
PORT=3000
NODE_ENV=production

### Security
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_key_here_change_in_production
